      "name": "a being with no method is a describe of that one being",
      "law": "The judgment",
      "obligations": ["XII-7"],
      "derivation": "An ask naming the Counter being and no method. Article XII: \"Being, no method — the warden describes that one being.\" That describe is Article IX's `sketch(being being) sketch?`, whose record is the being, the digest of its blueprint and its heir commitment — the same three things a class entry carries, for one being rather than an estate. The optional is present, because the voice reaches this being; a being it did not reach would be silence rather than an absent sketch, which Article X separates: \"a door that answered \\\"absent\\\" about a being you do not reach would be a door confirming that being exists.\"",
